The new HTML verification path throws RuntimeException on IO problems instead of using the existing MojoExecutionException flow, which may change how failures are reported/handled by the Maven plugin. Consider aligning exception types and error messaging with the rest of the verifier so build output is consistent and actionable.
</summary>

