`CredentialActionsDropdown` returns `null` when `!canDisconnect && !hasCache` (e.g. a delegation credential for a non-Google calendar). In that case the surrounding `<div className="flex w-32 justify-end">` is still mounted, injecting an invisible 8 rem placeholder into the actions area of the card. The same pattern repeats in the `Alert` branch below (lines 123-132).

