The handler never checks `booking.status`. A caller with organizer or attendee privileges can invoke this mutation on a `CANCELLED` or `REJECTED` booking, which will persist new attendee rows and attempt to send emails against a dead booking. The check should be added right after the `NOT_FOUND` guard:

